+Account and credit services for our meal-kit subscription. `src/db.mjs` stands in for the database (every call is asynchronous, like the real one) and `src/credits.mjs` keeps each account's credit balance in cents. Referrals: a member shares a code; when a new customer signs up with it, both get £15 of credit. A member can be rewarded for at most 5 referrals, and nobody can refer themselves. Each code works once.
